[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 60.349, "timestamp": "00:01:00", "text": "事情很多，我需要先休息一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 61.349, "timestamp": "00:01:01", "text": "而且是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 62.99, "timestamp": "00:01:02", "text": "9"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 68.83, "timestamp": "00:01:08", "text": "早上，所以有很多事情，嗯，很多……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 70.83, "timestamp": "00:01:10", "text": "事物"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 74.35, "timestamp": "00:01:14", "text": "总之，我们会进行防护，我会去的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 77.95, "timestamp": "00:01:17", "text": "沃德，我们今天要做的事情就是我们要做的事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 80.429, "timestamp": "00:01:20", "text": "我会事先发出一些警告，我们会这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 83.149, "timestamp": "00:01:23", "text": "音乐或者其他什么，我们会玩游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 86.59, "timestamp": "00:01:26", "text": "做其他事，我会按时完成。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 89.55, "timestamp": "00:01:29", "text": "自动化方面的东西也没问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 91.35, "timestamp": "00:01:31", "text": "我们将看看这是否是三个目标。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 94.99000000000001, "timestamp": "00:01:34", "text": "今天我们就来做这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 98.41, "timestamp": "00:01:38", "text": "好了，伙计们，就陪着我吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 105.35, "timestamp": "00:01:45", "text": "哦，让我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 108.03, "timestamp": "00:01:48", "text": "让我把链接发给你，看看是不是……"}]